              "text": "<h1><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Join Stryker at</span><span class=\"futura-bold\">&nbsp;ICSES 2026</span></span></span></span></span></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Join us in Vancouver, September 23-25, for hands-on demos, expert-led education and the latest in shoulder solutions.</span></span></span></span></p>\n",
