          "jcr:created": "Wed Jan 24 2024 19:35:28 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p>The material presented is intended for educational purposes only. A healthcare professional must always rely on their own professional clinical judgment when deciding whether to use a particular product when treating a particular patient. Stryker does not dispense medical advice and recommends that healthcare professionals be trained in the use of any particular product before using the product. Stryker does not endorse or support the unapproved uses of its products.</p>\n",
